        &={\left\vert\kern-0.25ex\left\vert\kern-0.25ex\left\vert u-u_{s-1}^* \right\vert\kern-0.25ex\right\vert\kern-0.25ex\right\vert}{\left\vert\kern-0.25ex\left\vert\kern-0.25ex\left\vert \frac{u-u_{s-1}^*}{{\left\vert\kern-0.25ex\left\vert\kern-0.25ex\left\vert u-u_{s-1}^* \right\vert\kern-0.25ex\right\vert\kern-0.25ex\right\vert}}-\frac{\psi_{s}}{{\left\vert\kern-0.25ex\left\vert\kern-0.25ex\left\vert \psi_{s} \right\vert\kern-0.25ex\right\vert\kern-0.25ex\right\vert}} \right\vert\kern-0.25ex\right\vert\kern-0.25ex\right\vert}\\
        &< 2\tau_{s}{\left\vert\kern-0.25ex\left\vert\kern-0.25ex\left\vert u-u_{s-1}^* \right\vert\kern-0.25ex\right\vert\kern-0.25ex\right\vert}.
    \end{aligned}
    \]
    The final step follows thanks to
